        "source_sha256": "adb2b7ce9d984f9c14ae43e2958f3a71441956335cb6a7e1054824a478b42fb4",
        "english": "I'm not sure the signal is even getting through...",
        "polish": "Nie jestem pewien, czy sygnał przechodzi.",
