        "source_sha256": "a35f1935ae628b63b6c9a19b6baa0b8f5d561ac3251ef21c2c20e32f5d543cc7",
        "english": "We're almost to the docks. According to Dr. Barisov the E-99 bomb is on a freighter called the Pearl.",
        "polish": "Według dr Barisowa, bomba E99 jest na statku Pearl.",
